            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Kipowi 0.6.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Export at Quarter as well as Full and Half — for video, for pictures and for frame stacks.</li>
<li>Write pictures and frame stacks as JPEG, alongside PNG, TIFF and TGA. A cutout is still written as PNG, since JPEG has no transparency.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
